                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans\u2019 health care crisis means health care workers like Heather will be put under even more strain at the hospital where she works. Small business owners like Jackie and her husband rely on the Affordable Care Act to afford their health insurance.\u00a0Moms like Jonna rely on Medicaid to take care of her children who have critical and chronic illnesses.\n\n@HouseDemocrats are in Washington today to amplify their voices \u2014 and all Americans. We are here and ready to work to save health care and reopen the government.",
