                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thanks to Republicans\u2019 attack on health care, higher health care costs mean busier emergency rooms, more pressure on health care workers, and the stark reality that many Americans will choose to forego insurance because they cannot afford it. \n\nAt our hearing, Steering & Policy @HouseDemocrats heard from health care providers and working Americans who will be hit the hardest by Republicans\u2019 health care crisis and refusal to extend tax credits that make coverage more affordable. But Democrats will continue to fight for lower health care costs.",
