                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Critical health care tax credits under the Affordable Care Act (ACA) are set to expire. If Trump and Republicans don\u2019t act, millions of Americans will see their health care premiums skyrocket.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nAre you and your family enrolled in health insurance under the ACA through Covered California? Find out how much your premiums will cost next year if these tax credits aren\u2019t extended by visiting https://t.co/eIiGHR4yrS\n\u00a0\nAre your expected costs higher than last year? Have you received\u00a0notice that your premiums are set to increase? TELL ME YOUR STORY: https://t.co/LInCrI13nx",
