                "text": "Do you know how much more Republicans are going to make you pay for your health insurance? \n\nI went out in #SouthGate today to hear from our community about the notices many Californians are getting telling them their out-of-pocket health care costs are about to go through the roof. We can\u2019t afford this Trump Republican health care crisis.",
