                "text": "\ud83d\udea8OPEN ENROLLMENT FOR 2026 HEALTH INSURANCE STARTS TODAY\ud83d\udea8\n\nPlease be aware that your insurance costs may be higher because of a health care crisis brought to you by Congressional Republicans.\n\nTo find the plan that best fits your needs and budget, visit https://t.co/0YkzXN0VK2.\n\nApply by December 31, 2025, for coverage that starts on January 1, 2026.",
