                "text": "Like Jon from Florida says, hardworking Americans are only one accident away from not being able to afford groceries or other daily expenses. \n\nHealth care is essential. Republicans\u2019 refusal to extend the tax credits that help lower the costs of health insurance will mean more people choose to go without it. We only need 4 Republicans to join @HouseDemocrats before the end of the year to extend the tax credits \u2014 if they don\u2019t, Republicans will force millions of Americans to forego care.",
